window.products.push({"id":481042,"name":"Lunarable Ethnic Microfiber Bedspread Set, Antique Motifs Vertical Ikat Stripes Mayan Cultural Heritage Tradition and Art, Soft Bedding Set with Pillo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uAhyGTKqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made from - Super-soft, comfortable and durable 100% Microfiber Fabric with 100% silicone filling.  Features - Heavyweight bedspread, decorative pillows as an accent piece. Suitable for cold climates. Machine washable - Cold cycle, Dryer safe. No Fading. Not prone to stretching or shrinkage. Printed with state of art digital technology. Item is printed on the front side. The back is solid colored. What do you expect from a bedspread set? Are you looking for a budget-friendly product that will fully meet your needs? You can set the aesthetic appeal of your bedroom with a Microfiber Bedspread set. You deserve to have the utmost comfort! Microfiber Bedspread Sets will create a stylish look in your room with thousands of pattern options, whether you choose a boho bedspread or navy bedspread. It is possible to find every color tone that will suit your decor. It will protect your mattress from dust and dirt during the day, as well as add elegance as an accent piece in your home decor. You can use these 100% Microfiber Bedspread Sets as a decorative piece in the summer. Thanks to its 100% silicone-filled inner structure it can be used as an extra layer to keep you warm in the cold winter season. Unlike the Chenille Bedspread texture, it is not delicate, does not fade easily, not prone to stretching, shrinkage, or distortion. Durable and Soft 100% Microfiber structure allows it to clean easily and to remain in the same beauty for years. Its print on one side, adds a different elegance to the decoration of your home. Combining %100 Microfiber quality with the most beautiful modish of patterns, the heavyweight bedspread is remarkable with its very soft texture and easy care of bedspread clearance. With the Microfiber Each Bedspread Set consisting of one bedspread and two matching pillow shams that you will have the bedroom decor of your dreams that you see on magazine covers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uAhyGTKqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lunarable","source_asin":"B0BR5SRG17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR5SRG17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR5SRG17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
