window.products.push({"id":481229,"name":"GINGPROUS Funny Christmas Birthday Mother's Day Gift for Grandma, Grandma Bear Travel Tumbler for Grandma Grandmother New Grandma, 20 Oz Stainless Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GH9LQoF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gingprous grandma bear insulated tumblers come with straws and cleaning brush, lids for wine, coffee, drinks, champagne, cocktails, beer, even for ice cream and so on. Every color every funny element bringing you different moods, the wine tumbler will be a unique, unforgettable gift idea for grandma, grandmother, mom, mother, new grandma, nana, gigi, grandma to be. Grandma Bear Insulated Tumbler Features: Say Goodbye to Water Rings on Tables And Drawers Full Of Coasters - Gingprous all insulated tumblers have a double-walled exterior with a vacuum seal between the walls which means your drink will stay at its ideal temperature for hours. Also the exterior will never sweat or get hot or cold to the touch. Durable and Environment-friendly - Made of high-quality food-grade 18/8 stainless steel, all Gingprous tumblers are durable and recyclable to cut down on household waste with every refill. Great Gift for All Ages - The insulated tumbler is perfect gift idea for Christmas, Mother's Day, birthday parties, anniversary, wedding, engagement, graduation, promotion, retiring and so on for all ages. Grandma Bear Insulated Tumbler Design Perfect Size -20 Oz capacity can totally satisfy your daily needs. Suitable size suitable for traveling, office and other place. User-Friendly Design - The tumbler with modern curved design is easy to hold. Removable cup lid can keep reduce the spill. Leak Proof Lid - Removable ABS lid tightly sits in your cup to prevent splash and spills. Also, the straw lid is perfect for cold beverages. Warm Notice: Not microwave safe. Keep children away from the wine tumbler when it is filled with hot liquid Handwash recommended - Wash with non-scratch sponges or cloth in warm water PACKAGE CONTENTS: 1 × Travel tumbler 2 × Lid 2 × Straw 1 × Cleaning brush and Straw Brush","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GH9LQoF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GINGPROUS","source_asin":"B08D7GQPFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D7GQPFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D7GQPFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
