window.products.push({"id":481303,"name":"Lofus Sherpa Fleece Weighted Blanket 15 lbs Heavy Blanket with Soft Plush Flannel Reversible Full-Size Super Soft Extra Warm Cozy Fluffy Blanket 48 x ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R8rp7pQ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unicolor, Unmatched Luxury: The upgraded version of Sherpa and flannel weighted blankets is super skin-friendly with match color on both sides bringing a whole lot of comfort and aesthetic. Designed to enhance deep and worry-free sleep with the proper weight offering cuddle-like and relaxing pressure to your body. Snuggle in it to feel the warmth on the couch, in the bed or anywhere. Industry-Leading Craftsmanship: Unique 7-layer construction ensures sleepers to experience maximum softness. The warm and soft fleece and Sherpa wrap up 2 extra polyester layers to avoid beads leakage, filled with nontoxic and environmental ceramic beads in the small pockets so that no noises would come out , and the blanket conforms to your body with a warm snuggly hug. Durable and Easy Cleaning: Fade-resistance and smudge-proof features of this Sherpa fleece blanket are much stronger than that of cotton blanket. Lofus weighted blanket are safe from pilling and deformation, you can spot cleaning or throw it into commercial washer. A great yet exclusive gift for your friends or families suffering from sleeplessness. Select Your Blanket: It is scientifically suggested that weight of the heavy blanket should be 10% of your body weight plus 1lb. Please refer to our size chart for precise selection. Comes with several sizes (48”x72” for twin/full size, 60”x80” for full/queen size), our weighted blanket can accompany you whether you are unwinding Indoor or camping outdoor. Customer First: We put our customers at the top consideration and are dedicated to offer them with the best shopping experience. Just reach us if you have any concerns or questions about this product, and we are always available to serve you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R8rp7pQ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lofus","source_asin":"B08GF7XDRP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GF7XDRP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GF7XDRP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":481304,"name":"All Season Duvet Insert Comforter-Soft Quilted Down Alternative Duvet Insert-Machine Washable Bedding-Plush Microfiber Fill Hotel Style with 8 Corner ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Ty-NiTPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌷🌷🌷【ULTRA SOFT & BREATHABLE】Covered by high quality fabric shows a graceful charm to you. The fabric is soft and breathable, suitable for all seasons. With a layer of short pile layer on the surface of the fabric, it not only reduces heat loss, but also increases the WARMTH & SOFTNESS, while giving the fabric a new style; 🌷🌷🌷【FLUFFY&LIGHTWEIGHT】Filled with whole piece 3D-Hollow Microfiber, a premium down alternative fiberfill, fluffy and lightweight. It fits body quickly while ensuring sleeping temperature(89.6℉-93.2℉). It prevents from clumping and it won’t form a weight burden on your body, providing you with a cozy sleeping experience. ★Tips: To completely fluff up this comforter, we suggest you put it into your dryer or expose it to the sunlight for a few hours. 🌷🌷🌷【EFFORTLESS CARE & CONVENIENCE】Machine washable, easy to wash and quick dry, strong and durable. Not shift or clump even after wash, with ZERO concern of leakage or ripping. Suitable for those who are not apt to use animal skins and feather products such as allergy-prone body, asthma patients, etc; 🌷🌷🌷【HYPOALLERGENIC & BREATHABLE】OEKO-TEX 100 CERTIFICATION, safe to use. Filled with plush microfiber down alternative fiber, without any feathers or plastic smell. Friendly to people allergic to feathers. It is an ALL-SEASON comforter with high-grade quilt stitching and durable hem hemming, filled with a single piece of chemical fiber, excellent materials and craftsmanship ensures longevity of the quilted down alternative duvet insert. 🌷🌷🌷【WHOLE PIECE FILLING & EXCELLENT SEWING】 Exquisite sewing technology, premium whole-piece filling, soft fluffy and well distributed. No shift or clump even after wash. With 8 built-in rings and side rings, you can fix your favorite quilt cover or it can be used as a Stand Alone Comforter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Ty-NiTPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOONCAST","source_asin":"B0894MJFV8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0894MJFV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0894MJFV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
