window.products.push({"id":481306,"name":"Folkulture Wooden Spoons for Cooking, Set of 5 Cooking Utensils Set for Kitchen, Non Stick Cookware Tools, 12 Inch Spoon, Wooden Spatula, Fork, Slotte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P6lCv5EDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KITCHENWARE SET- Add an elegant festive touch to your kitchen with this wooden kitchen utensil set of 5. It includes a serving spoon, spatula or turner, slotted spatula, fork and corner scraper spoon for better reach in pans and pots. MODERN DESIGN - A new way to upgrade your kitchen is by using these nonstick and eco friendly wooden spoons for cooking. It has long handles with comfort grip making it ideal for stirring, serving, mixing, tossing and tasting. HEALTHY AND SAFE COOKING- Our wood kitchen utensils are kitchen essentials that will not react with food or beverages. They are completely BPA free! HIGH QUALITY- Made in high-quality acacia wood, this beautiful cooking utensils set is durable, water resistant and long lasting. It even makes for the perfect Housewarming gifts or any other occasion. It is heat resistant and will save your cookware from any kind of scratch or damage. CARE- These spoons are easy to clean. We recommend washing these cooking spoons by hand only as they are not dishwasher friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P6lCv5EDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Folkulture","source_asin":"B07VR5S6TV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VR5S6TV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VR5S6TV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":481307,"name":"12 Inches Diamond Honing Steel Professional Knife Sharpener Rod, AHNR Kitchen Knife Sharpening Rod & Tungsten Carbide Multi-Sharpener for Honing Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p8eMSqPtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➰【GET RAZOR SHARP EDGE】Your knife, which may have previously felt sharp as a razor, starts to bite and catch on the food you're cutting. You can sense some resistance that wasn't there before. By running the blade along the honing steel, you can pull that microscopic edge of metal back into an upright position, and regain a good deal of its cutting power in the process. ➰【EASY & SAFE TO USE】 With a 12-inch honing steel, you'll be able to use the vertical honing method with little risk of the knife hitting the work surface below. Ergonomic handle fits all hands, making it easy to use. The slip-resistant bottom durable handle will make the rod easy to handle and will stay in place while being used, so it becomes safer for you. ➰【RETAINS MORE METAL ON YOUR KNIFE EDGE】The Honing steel sharpening rod is designed to be used often, it corrects the edge without shaving off much, if any, of the blade’s material. Its diamond coating gives kitchen knives an extremely fine sharpness when honed, quickly restoring their original cutting performance. ➰【PRUNER AND KNIFE SHARPENER】Comes with a pocket pruner sharpener. It is made with long-lasting, hard sharpening tungsten carbide and ergonomic textured rubber handle to make sharpening your tools a breeze! Designed for sharpening blades of garden tools including secateurs, grafting knives, loppers and even lawn mower blades. ➰【EASY TO STORAGE】The easiest way to keep your honing steel clean is to give it a quick clean after each and every use. This needn’t be a time-consuming process, simply wipe the honing steel with a dry cloth after every use. Please wipe dry completely after washing and hang in a cool place to air-dry, do not put the sharpener into the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p8eMSqPtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AHNR","source_asin":"B08FT2KT2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FT2KT2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FT2KT2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
