window.products.push({"id":481330,"name":"DreamsyUS DIY Oil Paint by Number Kit,Colorful Canvas Painting Paintworks Park Stree Light Wall Art Picture Drawing with Brushes 1620 inch Christmas D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712oiue0YAL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Painting *Paint by Number has become a style of art created by filling in pre-numbered areas on a canvas panel with matching colors of paint. This art form is popular again and Plaid is leading with more new designs for you to enjoy. *Great for familys, couple, friend can work together to paint one oil paint. Everyone will has fun when they work together.You make a white art canvas into yours unique oil paint with your sweet memory. *You will find out one more interesting thing to do in your leisure time and it is a good gift for parents,child,lover and friends when you finish the oil paint, it makes you feel a sense of achievement . The paint: *Drawing turn according to your personal favor or in turns of the numbers *The match the number of the paint and the figure on the canvas to fill in the paint *If you fill in a wrong color, you can wait the paint to get day and then cover the wrong part with the correct color on the surface The canvas: *Professional canvas design for DIY oilpainting The brush: *Wash the brush cleanly when you change to another color or don't want to paint *For the large part, you can use the larger brush to paint, and for the small part, you can use the smaller brush to paint Attention: *Wash the brush when you finish or stop painting *If you happen to have the paint on your clothe, please wash it immediately. *The paint we offer is enough for the normal use, please do not waste it in case of the paint shortage. *Please cover the lid of paint well when you do not use it, in case the paint gets dry. *The figures on the canvas may not be covered entirely, hope you do not mind it. Package Included: * 1x Pre-printed textured art canvas (Included Wood Frame) * 3x Brushes * 1 set of Acrylic paints * 2x Hook * 1x Number drawing renderings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712oiue0YAL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DreamsyUS","source_asin":"B07JB1DZMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JB1DZMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JB1DZMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
