window.products.push({"id":481559,"name":"Colonial Classic Dark Cherry Rectangular Dining Table by Home Styles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VfaDbHweL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The embodiment of elegance, the colonial classics collection by home styles provides a sophisticated retreat. Creating the kitchen of your dreams with beautiful craftsmanship such as mahogany solids and cherry veneers, easily removable leaf, and carved turned legs. Physically distressed using techniques such as worm holes and season splits adding further interest and character to this collection. The dining table is easily expandable to 66 inches using the 18 inch removable leaf. Finish and measurements may vary slightly. Assembly required. Size: 48w 36d 30h.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VfaDbHweL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Styles","source_asin":"B00MVUV5ZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MVUV5ZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MVUV5ZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":481560,"name":"Oriental Furniture 12\" Standing Prosperity Buddha Statue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pecITdXRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is another beautiful design of the \"Happy Buddha\", Laughing Buddha, or Lucky Buddha. A heavy and substantial reproduction, with the lucky pearl in one hand, and the lucky ingot of gold in the other. The faux wood carved finish is exceptional, as well as the detailed robe, beads, and bow. Referred to as Budai in Chinese, Hotei in Japanese, the Happy Buddha is thought to have been a Zen monk who traveled the far east in 10th century, a man of good and loving character. This version is traditionally given for new beginnings; graduation, Chinese New Year, a new business, wedding, engagement, a first child, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pecITdXRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIENTAL Furniture","source_asin":"B003DZFMBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003DZFMBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003DZFMBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
