window.products.push({"id":481642,"name":"Performa Justice League & DC Comic - Leak Free Protein Shaker Bottle with Actionrod Mixing Technology for All Your Protein Needs! Shatter Resistant & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G6XJnqQ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LEAK-FREE GUARANTEED - No other shaker cup on the market is designed to endure the wear and tear that a Peforma PerfectShaker does. Our proprietary design has been optimized to ensure that no matter how the cup is used, it will not leak. ACTIONROD TECHNOLOGY - This patented shaker agitation element is scientifically developed using the laws of motion. During the blending process the agitator and rod combine to form a high performance piston, colliding with high momentum in the opposite direction of the mixture. This rapid collision builds momentum within the cup as the fluid mixture accelerates and impact becomes intensified. The explosive impact results in instant emulsification and perfectly blended drinks every time. BPA FREE, DISHWASHER SAFE WITH EXTRALAST INK – Our shaker cups are 100% BPA free for the safest supplement consumption. Our Extralast Ink ensures that the design on your shaker cup stays pristine wash after wash. DURAPLEX SHATTER RESISTANT PLASTIC - Not all shaker bottles are made the same. The quality of the plastic used and its overall density play a key role in how shatter resistant it is. Performa PerfectShaker bottles use a specialized blend of polymers that ensure maximum shock absorption and elasticity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G6XJnqQ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PerfectShaker","source_asin":"B07667Q9RB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07667Q9RB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07667Q9RB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":481643,"name":"Hyoola 9 Inch Beeswax Taper Candles 12 Pack – Handmade, All Natural, 100% Pure Unscented Bee Wax Candle - Tall, Decorative, Golden Yellow – 5 Hour Bur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lZNEuFKDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great decoration, amazing functionality - that's the Hyoola way and our tapered beeswax candles are the best way to keep rooms beautifully alit while adding a classy touch to your home's decor. Made from 100% all natural beeswax and handcrafted right here in the USA, you're getting the best of the best with our candles. Great tapered design allows them to fit most standard sticks, wicks, and holders easily. Premium grade wax guarantee extreme durability and usability. PRODUCT FEATURES 12 Pack  9 Inches Tall  Tapered Design  Golden Yellow  Premium Beeswax  Natural Beeswax Scent  Handmade in the USA QUALITY MADE CANDLES Get the best candles available with Hyoola! They're quality produced candles from 100% all natural pure beeswax, and they emit a beeswax fragrance that will fill up your home for a truly soothing experience. The natural state of beeswax is that they burn a lot longer than regular wax candles without any addition of hardeners for a truly organic experience. They will remain lit for hours at a time so you know you're getting incredible usage out of them. Our beeswax candles are virtually dripless to create minimal mess. This makes them a lot easier to remove and replace whenever you need to fill up the room with new light and fresh scents. ELEGANT DESIGN Sleek tapered construction allow it to be a perfect decorative piece in any room. They fit in most candle holders and wicks for a sophisticated appearance. They are a bright yellow color which is ideal especially when using them as a source of light but also as for presentation - the vibrant yellow allow them to fit in all types of settings no matter what kind of style you're going for. BRIGHTEN YOUR DAY Brighten your party or special event with beautiful decorative candles from Hyoola.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lZNEuFKDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B07CMNZ6HB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CMNZ6HB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CMNZ6HB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
