window.products.push({"id":481908,"name":"Mophorn 110 x 46 Inch Clear Table Cover Protector, 2mm Thick Clear Desk Protector Table Pads, Plastic Tablecloth Table Protector for Dining Room Table","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ovMj8mocL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Secure PVC Material: Our 46 x 110-in transparent table cover is made of new material that does not have a plastic smell and is tasteless. The high-quality table mat can be in direct contact with food. It can keep the desk from damage while still showing the beauty of your desk and furniture top. Superior Performance: Our 2 mm thick PVC table protector is waterproof, scratchproof, skid-resistant and more protective for kitchen tables. It has excellent heat resistance (up to 80 °C/ 176 °F). At the same time, our tablecloth is very easy to clean. After wiping it with a rag, the cover will look good as new. How to Get a Flat Cover: 1. Heat it with a hairdryer to make it flat. 2. Soak it in hot water for a few minutes to make it flat. 3. Expose under sunshine for a few hours to make it flat. 4. Lay the table protector in a reverse-roll direction and put heavy items on it to make it flat. Cut to Fit Table Size: Our table protector will be bigger than the actual size due to possible shrinkage and deviation considerations during use. However, you can mark the exact measurement with sharp scissors, a pencil, and a ruler to make a perfect cut. Please find our support team if you wonder which size you should choose. It is our pleasure to help you. Extensive Application: It is suitable for wood, glass, marble, stainless steel desks, writing desks, coffee tables, TV cabinets, dressing tables, bedside cupboards, etc. The cover effectively keeps the top of furniture from becoming scratched, stained, etc. This transparent table-top protector can show the original beauty of your table and furniture tops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ovMj8mocL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mophorn","source_asin":"B0BG97VXYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-481908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG97VXYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG97VXYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
